<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbek 1996 budget deficit widens to 8.5 bln sum. [CORRECTED 15:37 GMT]</title>
<headline>Uzbek 1996 budget deficit widens to 8.5 bln sum. [CORRECTED 15:37 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects from trade deficit to budget deficit)</p>
<p>Uzbekistan's budget deficit widened to 8.5 billion sum in the first nine months of 1996 from 0.7 billion sum in the same period last year, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>--Shamil Baigin, Tashkent Newsroom, (3712) 361958</p>
</text>
